# Line endings: files that machines parse are LF everywhere (F-7, STEP-06 W6
# rehearsal: CRLF in constraints.txt broke pip's line continuation inside the
# Linux image). Text files are normalised on commit; these are forced LF on
# checkout too, on every platform.
* text=auto
constraints.txt text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
